        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nWhich of the following is equivalent to [MATH: 10, 000, 000, 000?]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: 10^{8}]\nb. [MATH: 10^{6}]\nc. [MATH: 10^{7}]\nd. [MATH: 10^{9}]\ne. [MATH: 10^{10}]"
